 "text": "Hey there, how are you? I like ten minutes per thin layer of paint, so ten minutes for five thin layers is only twenty minutes. Keep it in a room with a door you can lock. That's nice of you. Do you want simple wardrobe set, or something more unique but harder to find? There' a basic wardrobe set with a dresser, shirts on hangers, and pants in a drawer, or a travel set if space is an issue. Touch it for a few seconds, then wipe with a fresh part of the rag. If the paint isn't coming off, stop right away.",
